<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/ncmec_2025_960/admission/1> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "possessing child porn on several occasions, the document says, though he claimed he downloaded it to report uploaders..." ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.kltv.com/2025/03/20/gladewater-man-accused-uploading-child-porn-chat-service/> ;
    ns1:admissionContext "on Aug. 29. They say the investigation led to Leggett, whose home was searched on Oct. 2. Leggett reportedly admitted to possessing child..." ;
    ns1:admissionFrame "admitted_to" ;
    ns1:admissionTheme "harm_conduct",
        "tech_use" ;
    ns1:attributedToOffenderRole <https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/ncmec_2025_960/role/offender/1> ;
    ns1:evidenceTier "press_release_stated" ;
    ns1:quoteType "paraphrase" ;
    uco-core:description "possessing child porn on several occasions, the document says, though he claimed he downloaded it to report uploaders to law enforcement" .

<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/ncmec_2025_960/admission/2> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "owning and operating the accounts that had been uploading the videos, the affidavit says, and his arrest warrant was ..." ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.kltv.com/2025/03/20/gladewater-man-accused-uploading-child-porn-chat-service/> ;
    ns1:admissionContext "enforcement. According to the affidavit, he went on to say he never reported other users. Leggett admitted to owning and operating the ac..." ;
    ns1:admissionFrame "admitted_to" ;
    ns1:admissionTheme "tech_use" ;
    ns1:attributedToOffenderRole <https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/ncmec_2025_960/role/offender/1> ;
    ns1:evidenceTier "press_release_stated" ;
    ns1:quoteType "paraphrase" ;
    uco-core:description "owning and operating the accounts that had been uploading the videos, the affidavit says, and his arrest warrant was signed on March 14" .

